        "abstract": "Since its inception in 1998, the objective of the International Technology Roadmap for Semiconductors (ITRS) has been to identify the technical challenges that had to be addressed in order to ensure that microelectronics would be able to remain a driver for innovation in a wide range of applications. This has resulted in an industrial/academic agenda for pre-competitive research, which is continuously being updated to take into account new trends.",
